	<!--
	  Deliberately NOT requested:
	    get-task-allow                 -> would enable JIT, and requires a
	                                      development-signed build. Adding it
	                                      here would break ad-hoc signing and
	                                      is meaningless on a store build.
	    com.apple.developer.* (most)   -> Luna has no need for them.
	-->
